{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863194194637750322","content":"*Dear Ms. Eliza, I hope this letter finds you in good health. I apologize for causing any unrest between you and my daughter, that was not my intent. But please, tell her you are not interested in her. I don't care if it's a lie, she is confused, and needs that confusion resolved. The only things she said about you to me were brief, nothing compared to the hours she spent talking about Mr. Finn Midask. I do not want her to end up with a broken heart like her mother. Sincerely, Saria*","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:25:28.897000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868182042175766588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
